   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Shown: Momus working tree of 2026-11-25  |  scanner base kalilinux/kali-rolling@sha256:69a9a33d98a5  |  brain and seeder base python:3.13-slim@sha256:7249d5587b78  |  FastAPI 0.165.0, Starlette 1.10.0, Jinja2 3.1.6, Uvicorn 0.54.0",
