   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1   Sign-in: password, then a\n    session cookie\n\n2   Scope and the ownership\n    statement entered\n\n3   Job file to the scanner: a\n    scope-sync job first\n\n4   DNS proof: TXT query to the\n    domain's nameservers\n\n5   Inventory job: discovery,\n    DNS, and HTTP and TLS\n    probes to every live host\n\n6   Approval of one inventory\n\n7   Full scan: probes to the\n    approved targets only\n\n8   Evidence minimized and\n    redacted into the scan DB\n\n9   Snapshot published with\n    its SHA-256\n\n10  Brain copies the snapshot\n    and checks its hash\n\n11  Result pages to the browser,\n    every value escaped\n\n12  Analyst run to the provider,\n    after consent\n\n13  Proposal accepted by a\n    person, then a stored mark\n\n14  Version watch, from the\n    scheduler as a job\n\n15  Seeding: names from your DNS\n    services, back to the gate",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1   Sign-in: password, then a\n    session cookie\n\n2   Scope and the ownership\n    statement entered\n\n3   Job file to the scanner: a\n    scope-sync job first\n\n4   DNS proof: TXT query to the\n    domain's nameservers\n\n5   Inventory job: discovery,\n    DNS, and HTTP and TLS\n    probes to every live host\n\n6   Approval of one inventory\n\n7   Full scan: probes to the\n    approved targets only\n\n8   Evidence minimized and\n    redacted into the scan DB\n\n9   Snapshot published with\n    its SHA-256\n\n10  Brain copies the snapshot\n    and checks its hash\n\n11  Result pages to the browser,\n    every value escaped\n\n12  Analyst run to the provider,\n    after consent\n\n13  Proposal accepted by a\n    person, then a stored mark\n\n14  Version watch, from the\n    scheduler as a job\n\n15  Seeding: names from your DNS\n    services, back to the gate",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
